    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out and the reactor is on the brink of meltdown. Explore the facility and manipulate the many electrical hazards and locked doors to find a way deeper, towards the source of the problem. Your only tool: a mechanical grabber-arm allowing you to lift and move boxes from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think hard, because the reactor core could go into meltdown at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>The Electrifying Incident</i> is a small, bite-sized experience - about 30-90 minutes for most players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.poster.avif?t=1751971280\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.webm?t=1751971280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.mp4?t=1751971280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and adorable new adventure from the team behind <i>A Monster\u2019s Expedition </i>and <i>A Good Snowman is Hard to Build</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant puzzle design with escalating complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-90 minutes play time, ideal for a single play session.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out and the reactor is on the brink of meltdown. Explore the facility and manipulate the many electrical hazards and locked doors to find a way deeper, towards the source of the problem. Your only tool: a mechanical grabber-arm allowing you to lift and move boxes from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think hard, because the reactor core could go into meltdown at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong><i>The Electrifying Incident</i> is a small, bite-sized experience - about 30-90 minutes for most players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.poster.avif?t=1751971280\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.webm?t=1751971280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352300/extras/a9578838e5690971450bb38cc12d7842.mp4?t=1751971280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and adorable new adventure from the team behind <i>A Monster\u2019s Expedition </i>and <i>A Good Snowman is Hard to Build</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant puzzle design with escalating complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-90 minutes play time, ideal for a single play session.</p></li></ul>",
